sup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>","file":"ch13-psd-and-svd/10-polar-decomposition.html"}